1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,960
99% log is MATH PUZZLE mein fail ho jaate hain!

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,780
Ek chor dukan par aata hai

3
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,240
aur ₹200 ka saman khareedta hai,

4
