9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,520
Chor chala gaya!

10
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,460
Agli subah padosi gusse mein bola:

11
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:31,240
"Bhai, yeh ₹500 ka note NAKLI hai!"

12
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,740
Dukaandar ko apni jeb se ₹500

13
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,600
padosi ko wapas dene pade.

14
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,340
Toh ab bataiye: Dukaandar ka TOTAL LOSS kitna hua?

15
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,100
₹500?

16
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,400
₹800?

17
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,740
Ya fir ₹1000?

18
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:50,460
Comment mein apna jawab likhiye, 90% log galat honge!
